<view class="page">
  <view class="score-card">
    <view class="score-label">当前信用分</view>
    <view class="score-value">{{score}}</view>
    <view class="score-user">{{student.name}} · {{student.studentNo}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{suspended}}" class="card suspended-card">
    <view class="section-title" style="color: #b91c1c;">账号暂停预约中</view>
    <view class="muted">暂停至 {{suspendedText}}。暂停期间无法创建新预约。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">违约规则</view>
    <view class="rule-row">
      <text>30 天内违约次数</text>
      <text class="rule-strong">{{noShowCount}} / {{noShowLimit}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-row">
      <text>每次违约扣分</text>
      <text class="rule-strong">10 分</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-row">
      <text>累计 3 次暂停预约</text>
      <text class="rule-strong">7 天</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 10rpx;">
      超时未签到会被系统自动释放并记违约，对处理结果有异议可以提交申诉。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">信用记录</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中...</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{records.length === 0}}" class="empty">暂无信用记录，继续保持</view>
    <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record-row">
      <view>
        <view class="record-title">{{item.typeLabel}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.occurredText}} · {{item.resource_name || '预约 #' + item.booking_id}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="muted">{{item.note}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tag {{item.status === 'VALID' ? 'tag-red' : 'tag-gray'}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{released.length > 0}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">可申诉的预约</view>
    <view wx:for="{{released}}" wx:key="id" class="released-row">
      <view>
        <view class="record-title">{{item.resourceName}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.timeText}} · 已被自动释放</view>
      </view>
      <button class="btn-ghost btn-small" bindtap="appeal" data-id="{{item.id}}">申诉</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">我的申诉</view>
    <view wx:if="{{appeals.length === 0}}" class="empty">暂无申诉记录</view>
    <view wx:for="{{appeals}}" wx:key="id" class="record-row">
      <view>
        <view class="record-title">{{item.resource_name}} · {{item.createdText}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.result}}" class="muted">处理结果：{{item.result}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tag {{item.status === 'APPROVED' ? 'tag-green' : item.status === 'REJECTED' ? 'tag-red' : 'tag-orange'}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
